      "content": "i see. but isn't it a bit unfair to call it \"short-sighted\" when people are literally talking about their livelihoods? if the city pulls funding from roads to build a train that won't be finished for 10 years, those people are in trouble now. isn't there a legitimate need to balance modern transit goals with the actual, current mobility needs of drivers?",
